activity Report Disease Outbreak
activity Verify Outbreak Report
activity Initiate Investigation
activity Collect Samples
activity Analyze Samples
activity Confirm Disease
activity Implement Control Measures
activity Inform Public
activity Monitor Disease Spread
activity Declare End of Outbreak
bind Report Disease Outbreak: Report Source, Number of Cases
bind Verify Outbreak Report: Investigation Result
bind Confirm Disease: Disease Type, Mortality Rate
bind Implement Control Measures: Control Measures, Days to Control
bind Inform Public: Public Response
Report Source: Hospital, Clinic, Public, Other
Number of Cases: integer between 1 and 1000
Disease Type: float between None and None
Mortality Rate: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Control Measures: Vaccination, Quarantine, Hygiene Campaign, Social Distancing
Days to Control: integer between 1 and 365
Investigation Result: Confirmed, False Alarm, Inconclusive
Public Response: Cooperative, Anxious, Resistant
Init[Report Disease Outbreak] | |
End[Declare End of Outbreak] | |
Existence[Collect Samples] | |
Existence[Analyze Samples] | |
Absence2[Declare End of Outbreak] | |
Exactly[Confirm Disease] | |
Responded Existence[Implement Control Measures, Inform Public] | | |
Precedence[Initiate Investigation, Verify Outbreak Report] |A.Investigation Result is Confirmed | |
Precedence[Confirm Disease, Analyze Samples] | | |
Response[Report Disease Outbreak, Verify Outbreak Report] | | |
Response[Confirm Disease, Implement Control Measures] |A.Mortality Rate > 5.0 | |
Succession[Collect Samples, Analyze Samples] | | |
Alternate Response[Implement Control Measures, Monitor Disease Spread] | | |
Chain Response[Verify Outbreak Report, Initiate Investigation] |A.Investigation Result is Confirmed | |
Chain Succession[Confirm Disease, Implement Control Measures] | | |
Co-Existence[Implement Control Measures, Monitor Disease Spread] | | |
Choice[Inform Public, Monitor Disease Spread] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Declare End of Outbreak, Implement Control Measures] | | |
Not Responded Existence[Declare End of Outbreak, Report Disease Outbreak] | | |
Not Precedence[Confirm Disease, Declare End of Outbreak] | | |
Not Response[Declare End of Outbreak, Initiate Investigation] | | |
Not Chain Succession[Report Disease Outbreak, Declare End of Outbreak] | | |